================================================================================
BASHO (https://basho.fueko.net) — MISSING & CORRUPTED FILES LOG
Original Export Type: Chrome DevTools "Save All Resources"
Audit & Offline Reconstruction Date: 2026-11-05
================================================================================

SUMMARY
-------
The original Chrome "Save All Resources" export contained 295 files across 6
domain folders (`basho.fueko.net`, `cdn.synaps.media`, `fonts.googleapis.com`,
`fonts.gstatic.com`, `js.stripe.com`, `m.stripe.network`), of which 254 files
were unpacked Rollup/Webpack sourcemap files (`node_modules/pnpm/...`) rather
than runtime assets.

Auditing the export against the live site (https://basho.fueko.net) revealed:
  - 3 Corrupted ("No Content:") files saved as plain-text error stubs
  - 3 Missing lazy-loaded post feature images on the homepage
  - 6 Missing <picture> fallback <img> author avatar JPEGs
  - 6 Missing Inter v20 unicode-range font subsets referenced in css2.css
  - 2 Missing UI/browser assets (Sodo Search main.css + /favicon.ico)
  - 7 Missing dynamic Ghost API / Analytics endpoints & Page 2 pagination HTML
  - 7 Missing older post feature images referenced in Page 2 / Search API
  - 5 Missing JavaScript sourcemaps (.map files referenced by Ghost scripts)
  - 39 Unexported secondary internal routes (posts, authors, tags, static pages)

All runtime assets required for the homepage, fonts, slider, "Load more"
pagination (Page 2), Ghost Portal, and Search have been restored and localized.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. CORRUPTED FILES IN ORIGINAL EXPORT ("No Content:" Stubs)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Chrome's "Save All Resources" extension writes `No Content: <url>` when a
resource's response body buffer has been evicted from DevTools memory or lives
in an isolated cross-origin iframe/font cache.

1.1. fonts.gstatic.com/s/inter/v20/UcC73FwrK3iLTeHuS_nVMrMxCp50SjIa1ZL7W0Q5nw.woff2
     - Exported Size : 98 bytes (corrupted text: "No Content: https://fonts.gstatic.com/...")
     - Live Size     : 48,432 bytes (valid WOFF2 binary, Inter v20 Latin subset)
     - Impact        : Primary Latin font failed to decode (`OTS parsing error`),
                       causing the page to fall back to system sans-serif instead
                       of Inter (weights 300, 400, 500, 700).
     - Resolution    : Restored valid 48,432-byte WOFF2 binary to
                       `assets/fonts/inter/UcC73FwrK3iLTeHuS_nVMrMxCp50SjIa1ZL7W0Q5nw.woff2`.

1.2. js.stripe.com/v3/m-outer-3437aaddcdf6922d623e172c2d6f9278.html
     - Exported Size : 82 bytes (corrupted text: "No Content: https://js.stripe.com/...")
     - Impact        : Stripe v3 outer metrics controller iframe HTML was empty.
     - Resolution    : Reconstructed valid HTML shell at
                       `assets/js/vendor/stripe/m-outer-3437aaddcdf6922d623e172c2d6f9278.html`
                       loading `m-outer-15a2b40a058ddff1cffdb63779fe3de1.js`.

1.3. m.stripe.network/inner.html
     - Exported Size : 47 bytes (corrupted text: "No Content: https://m.stripe.network/inner.html")
     - Impact        : Stripe v3 inner telemetry iframe HTML was empty.
     - Resolution    : Reconstructed valid HTML shell at
                       `assets/js/vendor/stripe/inner.html` loading `out-4.5.45.js`.

