3. MISSING <picture> FALLBACK AUTHOR AVATAR IMAGES (Non-WebP Paths)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Every author avatar in `index.html` uses a `<picture>` element with:
  - `<source srcset=".../size/w300/format/webp/2022/03/<file>.jpg" type="image/webp">`
  - `<img src=".../size/w300/2022/03/<file>.jpg">`
Chrome only downloaded the WebP `<source>` files (`.../format/webp/...`), leaving
all 6 fallback `<img src="...">` paths missing. Furthermore, `imagesLoaded` in
`assets/js/index.js` inspects `img.src` (`this.proxyImage.src = this.img.src`),
which triggers requests for the `.jpg` fallback URLs.

3.1. https://cdn.synaps.media/basho/content/images/size/w300/2022/03/alison-erickson-Zt8IkNfhk54-unsplash.jpg (12,792 bytes)
3.2. https://cdn.synaps.media/basho/content/images/size/w300/2022/03/good-faces-onKIR2oTW0o-unsplash.jpg (11,532 bytes)
3.3. https://cdn.synaps.media/basho/content/images/size/w300/2022/03/joshua-oyebanji-kMC1v6rBHMI-unsplash-2.jpg (12,734 bytes)
3.4. https://cdn.synaps.media/basho/content/images/size/w300/2022/03/kazi-mizan-ItjRqGiei5g-unsplash.jpg (8,854 bytes)
3.5. https://cdn.synaps.media/basho/content/images/size/w300/2022/03/matheus-ferrero-dlYiklmLIGg-unsplash.jpg (10,012 bytes)
3.6. https://cdn.synaps.media/basho/content/images/size/w300/2022/03/seth-doyle-wys9Jty8wNQ-unsplash.jpg (16,360 bytes)
     - Resolution    : Restored all 6 `.jpg` files alongside `.webp` files in
                       `assets/images/authors/`.

