4. MISSING INTER v20 FONT SUBSETS REFERENCED IN fonts.googleapis.com/css2.css
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
`fonts.googleapis.com/css2.css` defines 28 `@font-face` rules across 7 unicode
ranges for weights 300, 400, 500, and 700, referencing 7 `.woff2` files. Only
the Latin filename was present in `fonts.gstatic.com/s/inter/v20/` (and it was
corrupted). The other 6 unicode-range files were completely missing:

4.1. https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/inter/v20/UcC73FwrK3iLTeHuS_nVMrMxCp50SjIa2JL7W0Q5n-wU.woff2 (cyrillic-ext, 25,844 bytes)
4.2. https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/inter/v20/UcC73FwrK3iLTeHuS_nVMrMxCp50SjIa0ZL7W0Q5n-wU.woff2 (cyrillic, 18,744 bytes)
4.3. https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/inter/v20/UcC73FwrK3iLTeHuS_nVMrMxCp50SjIa2ZL7W0Q5n-wU.woff2 (greek-ext, 11,272 bytes)
4.4. https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/inter/v20/UcC73FwrK3iLTeHuS_nVMrMxCp50SjIa1pL7W0Q5n-wU.woff2 (greek, 19,044 bytes)
4.5. https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/inter/v20/UcC73FwrK3iLTeHuS_nVMrMxCp50SjIa2pL7W0Q5n-wU.woff2 (vietnamese, 10,280 bytes)
4.6. https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/inter/v20/UcC73FwrK3iLTeHuS_nVMrMxCp50SjIa25L7W0Q5n-wU.woff2 (latin-ext, 85,272 bytes)
     - Resolution    : Restored all 6 `.woff2` files into `assets/fonts/inter/`
                       and updated `assets/css/fonts.css` to reference `../fonts/inter/`.

