7. MISNAMED FILES & EXTRANEOUS SOURCEMAP CLUTTER IN ORIGINAL EXPORT
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
7.1. `js.stripe.com/v3/index.html` (1,174,460 bytes)
     - Actually the Stripe v3 JavaScript bundle (`https://js.stripe.com/v3/`),
       which Chrome saved as `index.html` because the script URL ended with `/`.
     - Resolution    : Renamed to `assets/js/vendor/stripe-v3.js` and updated
                       `<script async src="/assets/js/vendor/stripe-v3.js">`.

7.2. Unpacked Sourcemap Tree (`cdn.synaps.media/npm/...` — 254 files)
     - `cdn.synaps.media/npm/node_modules/pnpm/...`
     - `cdn.synaps.media/npm/packages/...`
     - `cdn.synaps.media/npm/@tryghost/portal@2.72.18/src/...`
     - These were virtual source files unpacked by DevTools from `portal.min.js.map`
       and are never requested by the browser at runtime. Removed during cleanup.

