8. UNEXPORTED SECONDARY PAGES (Single-Page Export Scope)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Because "Save All Resources" only exports resources loaded by the active page
(`https://basho.fueko.net/`), internal `<a href="...">` links to other pages on
the Ghost site were not part of the export:
  - Navigation / Static Pages:
    `/style-guide/`, `/membership/`, `/tags/`, `/authors/`, `/subscribe/`,
    `/contact/`, `/signup/`, `/signin/`, `/404/`, `/demo-account-member/`, `/rss/`
